					)
				)
			)
			(property "Package" "20.0 x 14.0 x 3.0 mm castellated module, 22 pads, 1.27 mm pitch with a 5.57 mm gap at the IPEX end - all dimensioned directly in the Ebyte manual chapter 3. VCC range 2.5-3.6 V. Pin 16 is MISO multiplexed with GDO1. Pins 6, 7, 8, 10 and 13 are vendor NC (no connection needed) and are typed no_connect. GDO2 (14) may be left unconnected per the manual, which states SPI polling can obtain interrupt status although an MCU external interrupt is recommended; AQROOT does not allocate a GPIO for it. Antenna: module IPEX/u.FL used for Beta with Taoglas FXP450.07.0100C; pin 21 ANT stamp hole present but NOT routed. RF DO NOT ROUTE until final RF review."
				(at 0 0 0)
				(hide yes)
				(effects
					(font
						(size 1.27 1.27)
					)
				)
			)
