			(property "Package" "20.0 x 14.0 x 3.0 mm castellated SMD module, 22 pads, 1.27 mm pitch with a 5.57 mm gap at the IPEX end. Antenna: module IPEX/u.FL used for Beta with Taoglas FXP890.07.0100C; pin 21 ANT stamp hole present but NOT routed. DIO2 (8) is strapped locally to TXEN (7) - firmware MUST enable SX1262 SetDIO2AsRfSwitchCtrl. RXEN (6) needs an external control; RF DO NOT ROUTE until final RF review."
